@startuml 15_state_host
title Host reporting state and revocation precedence (target)
[*] --> PENDING : approved + registered, no sample
PENDING --> CONNECTED : first valid report
CONNECTED --> CONNECTED : report accepted
CONNECTED --> STALE : silence > 35 seconds
STALE --> CONNECTED : valid report received
PENDING --> REVOKED : admin revoke
CONNECTED --> REVOKED : admin revoke
STALE --> REVOKED : admin revoke
REVOKED --> [*] : retained for audit / optional later purge
note right of STALE : Stale is last-known, NOT proof of host shutdown.
note right of REVOKED : Rejection immediate; old token never valid again.
@enduml
